{"ref":"BDB, מַצָּב²","hw":"מַצָּב²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַצָּב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.23\">1 S 13:23</a></sup> <strong>standing-place, station, garrison</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.15\">1 S 14:15</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצַּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:3\" href=\"/Joshua.4.3\">Jos 4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:9\" href=\"/Joshua.4.9\">9</a> + (Baer in Sm <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצָּב</span>, cf. on <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.23\">1 S 13:23</a>, but v. Ginsb); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצָּבֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.19\">Is 22:19</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>standing-place</em> of feet <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:3\" href=\"/Joshua.4.3\">Jos 4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:9\" href=\"/Joshua.4.9\">9</a> (JE).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>station, office</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.19\">Is 22:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲמָד</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>garrison, post</em>, or <em>outpost</em> (of Philistines) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.23\">1 S 13:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.1\">14:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.14\">2 S 23:14</a>; so read also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.12\">1 S 14:12</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצָּבָה</span>) 𝔊 Th We Bu HPS.","next":"BDB, מֻצָּב","prev":"BDB, נְצִיב²"}